{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/86c82d3d09ce7fee723e99e25373f530.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=1600 height=1002 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/86c82d3d09ce7fee723e99e25373f530.webm?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/fd23df100bd26d36e25a5f3388503382.avif?t=1764337092\" width=732 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Madness Afloat, 1\u20134 players pilot cursed steamships through nightmarish sea routes haunted by mutated wrecks, eldritch shrines and sanity-shredding anomalies. Every voyage is short, but every decision may leave a scar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/225003578e0b2bb06f16106f42130453.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=622 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/225003578e0b2bb06f16106f42130453.webm?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/225003578e0b2bb06f16106f42130453.mp4?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/d0bc0490476a24515c862f14f071a7f1.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/d0bc0490476a24515c862f14f071a7f1.webp?t=1764337092 width=1600 height=151 /></span>Haul volatile cargo through hostile waters. Each crate, be it fragile, cursed, hot/cold or explosive, must be snapped into your ship\u2019s grid. Misplace one or take too many hits, and you risk chain reactions, melting sanity or a hold-wide detonation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/51370bd663f002e0b8a286c3803ab909.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=622 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/51370bd663f002e0b8a286c3803ab909.webm?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/51370bd663f002e0b8a286c3803ab909.mp4?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/22f3b3e70fd2881724ffe4eaf9a275cb.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/22f3b3e70fd2881724ffe4eaf9a275cb.webp?t=1764337092 width=1600 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity is shared across your crew. As fear mounts, hallucinations distort targeting, vision, and even commands. Ride the Edge for brief clarity and power or tumble into madness. Shrine bargains, officer traumas, and cursed cargo echo across dives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/710b38de09b9150821fbd8eda5d3ac6f.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=622 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/710b38de09b9150821fbd8eda5d3ac6f.webm?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/710b38de09b9150821fbd8eda5d3ac6f.mp4?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/1a8f048e2941d802a1bdb8ea946fcfed.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/1a8f048e2941d802a1bdb8ea946fcfed.webp?t=1764337092 width=1600 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each 20\u201330 minute dive leaves lasting marks. Ships evolve with new hull modules and systems. Named officers, drawn from rival factions, gain traits, traumas and unique abilities. Your standing with these factions affects who will join you and who might turn away. Boons stack. Debts accrue. You\u2019ll return stronger, but not unscarred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/bca7acf99eeb7fc3aa4ab25d22db1e33.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=622 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/bca7acf99eeb7fc3aa4ab25d22db1e33.webm?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/bca7acf99eeb7fc3aa4ab25d22db1e33.mp4?t=1764337092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/88ea98bbff54fba21924548ebd288325.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/88ea98bbff54fba21924548ebd288325.webp?t=1764337092 width=1600 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a full crew, anyone can cover the essentials. Deeper coordination unlocks role synergies, kit combos and multi-ship strategies for high-tier anomalies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/9e7073f2128324d12a70e10a3c0fa699.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/9e7073f2128324d12a70e10a3c0fa699.avif?t=1764337092 width=800 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/052d19825fc529592ecce11b25e47048.avif?t=1764337092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras_big/052d19825fc529592ecce11b25e47048.webp?t=1764337092 width=1600 height=151 /></span>In an alternate 1899, the Polynesian archipelago of Tuva\u2019i is unraveling. Imperial ambition has awakened something ancient. Face warring factions, forbidden shrines and whispering seas in a world where every storm remembers and some voices never stop calling.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/bbdf44a6c4e4dbb872664e09f31bcde0.poster.avif?t=1764337092\" width=622 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/bbdf44a6c4e4dbb872664e09f31bcde0.webm?t=1764337092\